{"id":"n14379-1-8","stage":1,"title":"데려오다 · 带来","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14379-1-8-1","ko":"내일 공연에 친구를 데려와도 돼?","zh":"明天演出可以带朋友一起来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}},{"text":"공연에","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공연에","audio":"/audio/077f7a9cb311762b9459.mp3"}},{"text":"친구를","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구를","audio":"/audio/3c7703f0cd2530410491.mp3"}},{"text":"데려와도","meaning":"带来，领来，招来","explanation":"데려오다：带来，领来，招来；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"데려오다","audio":"/audio/dda28e1d8e7483e3636f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14379","senseId":"1","lemma":"데려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데려와도","audio":"/audio/672fab2600e99b8983b5.mp3"}},{"text":"돼?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"dda28e1d8e7483e3","term":"데려오다","zh":"带来，领来，招来","audio":"/audio/dda28e1d8e7483e3636f.mp3","entryId":"14379","definition":"让他人跟自己一起来。","pronunciation":["데려오다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2b4703f4e601de44d7fa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14379-1-8-2","ko":"물론이지. 그럼 내가 두 자리를 예약해 놓을게.","zh":"当然可以。那我就帮你预好两个座位吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물론이지.","meaning":"当然，不用说","explanation":"물론：当然，不用说；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"물론","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89812","senseId":"1","lemma":"물론","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물론이지","audio":"/audio/8067e1d6097584747ac7.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"자리를","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리를","audio":"/audio/516d8c7572e851763074.mp3"}},{"text":"예약해","meaning":"预约，预订","explanation":"예약하다：预约，预订；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"예약하다","audio":"/audio/2bf93bc3434e8c476626.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14154","senseId":"1","lemma":"예약하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예약해","audio":"/audio/3f84a6b3765bf4e7e50f.mp3"}},{"text":"놓을게.","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续；을게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓을게","audio":"/audio/6fa87309430dd2e9e5c7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86ee58f45cccde99","term":"물론","zh":"当然，不用说","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3","entryId":"89812","definition":"没有必要说的。","pronunciation":["물론"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"2bf93bc3